sion → policy → approval → execute → audit.</p></article><article class="bento-tile"><h3>Agent Teams canvas</h3><p>A free-form drag-and-drop graph builder wires agents, conditions and approval gates into a named, versioned team on the same durable Execution Graph Runtime that also powers Workflows and Pipelines.</p></article><article class="bento-tile"><h3>Memory &amp; Document RAG</h3><p>Session, Working and Entity memory alongside an agent's own persistent Memory document, plus real chunked, embedded Knowledge Sources a search_knowledge call always cites.</p></article></div>
